  "id": "vi-t-writing-exam-strategy",
  "group": "Viết",
  "title": "VSTEP B2 Writing Strategy Guide",
  "md": "# VSTEP B2 Writing Strategy Guide\n\n## 1. Word Count Requirements (Yêu cầu độ dài)\n\n### Task 1: Letter Writing (Viết thư)\n- **Minimum Requirement:** 120 words.\n- **Ideal Range (Khuyên dùng):** 130 - 160 words.\n- **Timing:** Should spend about **20 minutes**.\n- **Tip:** \n  - Đảm bảo đủ 3 phần: Mở bài (Lý do viết), Thân bài (Giải quyết 3 yêu cầu đề bài - bullet points), Kết bài.\n  - Đừng viết lan man, đi thẳng vào vấn đề.\n\n### Task 2: Essay Writing (Viết luận)\n- **Minimum Requirement:** 250 words.\n- **Ideal Range (Khuyên dùng):** 260 - 300 words.\n- **Timing:** Should spend about **40 minutes**.\n- **Tip:**\n  - **Introduction:** 30-40 words (Paraphrase đề bài + Thesis statement).\n  - **Body 1 & 2:** 90-100 words each (Topic sentence + Explanation + Example).\n  - **Conclusion:** 30-40 words (Summarize points).\n\n## 2. Topic Checklist (Danh sách chủ đề)\n\n### Core Academic Topics (Đã có)\n1. Education\n2. Environment\n3. Health\n4. Technology\n5. Transport & Traffic\n6. Work & Business\n7. Artificial Intelligence\n\n### Recommended Additional Topics (Nên bổ sung)\n8. **Travel & Tourism:** (E.g., Benefits of travel, Ecotourism).\n9. **Media & Entertainment:** (E.g., Influence of TV/Internet, Celebrity culture).\n10. **Family & Society:** (E.g., Generation gap, Urban vs Rural life).",
