  "title": "Speaking Part 1: Mẫu câu thông dụng",
  "md": "# Speaking Part 1: Mẫu câu thông dụng\n\n## Topic: Hobbies\n- I’m really into [activity]...\n- I’m a big fan of...\n- Whenever I have spare time, I usually...\n- It helps me to let my hair down / blow off some steam.\n\n## Topic: Work/Study\n- Currently, I am a student at [University Name] / I am working as a [Job] at [Company].\n- What I like most about my job/school is the friendly environment.\n- It is quite stressful/challenging but I learn a lot from it.\n\n## Topic: Hometown\n- I was born and raised in [City], which is located in the North/South of Vietnam.\n- It is famous for [Food/Place].\n- The people there are very hospitable and friendly.",
